# Build artifacts. There was no .gitignore in this repository before
# Phase 11 — "seed", the CLI binary produced by `go build -o seed
# ./cmd/seed` (the exact command used throughout this project's own
# development sessions), sat untracked in the repo root the entire time,
# one `git add .` away from being committed by accident. This file exists
# so that risk is closed, not just avoided by habit.
/seed
/seed.exe
/seed-bin
/seed-bin.exe
/build/
/dist/
/coverage.out

# Go
*.test
*.out

# Editor/OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
